1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,352
这是一个发往 port 3000 的请求，这个应用的前端就跑在那里
Here is a request to port 3000, where this app's frontend runs.

2
00:00:04,672 --> 00:00:07,125
它要两条简报，也拿到了
It asks for two newsletters and gets them.

3
00:00:07,445 --> 00:00:11,537
可你看是谁应答的：uvicorn，也就是 API 的服务器
But look who answered: uvicorn, the API's server,

4
00:00:11,537 --> 00:00:14,293
而 API 监听的是 port 9000
and the API listens on port 9000.

5
00:00:14,533 --> 00:00:17,093
这个应用去年的版本不是这样工作的
Last year's version of this app worked differently.

6
00:00:17,413 --> 00:00:23,542
它的页面直接调用 port 9000，每个回答都带着一张许可条
Its page called port 9000 directly, and every answer carried a permission slip:

7
00:00:23,542 --> 00:00:25,947
access-control-allow-origin，星号
access-control-allow-origin: *.

8
00:00:26,183 --> 00:00:29,084
今年的 API 根本不发这种许可条
This year's API sends no such slip at all.

9
00:00:29,404 --> 00:00:33,186
那么，是谁把请求从 3000 送到 9000 的
So who carried the request from 3000 to 9000, and why

10
00:00:33,186 --> 00:00:35,826
去年的页面又为什么需要许可？
did last year's page need permission?

11
00:00:36,067 --> 00:00:39,911
课上把一条聊天消息画成六个编号步骤
The lecture draws one chat message as six numbered steps:

12
00:00:39,911 --> 00:00:44,835
请求、转发、映射进 container、运行函数、响应、显示
request, forward, map into a container, run a function, respond, show it.

13
00:00:45,155 --> 00:00:48,739
我们加上课上从没画出的一步：第 3.5 步，信使
We add one step it never draws: three and a half, the courier.

14
00:00:49,567 --> 00:00:54,772
拉远一点看，这就是课上整个应用的蓝图，还是那三个端口
Zoom out, and this is the lecture's blueprint for the whole app, with the same three ports.

15
00:00:55,092 --> 00:00:57,729
课上先说应用已经准备好了，接着又承认
The lecture calls the app ready, then admits:

16
00:00:57,729 --> 00:00:59,956
其实还没有，我们得把它建出来
well, not really, we need to build it.

17
00:01:00,276 --> 00:01:03,369
今天我们在你的笔记本上，把右半边建出来
Today we build the right-hand side, on your laptop.

18
00:01:03,617 --> 00:01:06,328
要跟着做，先把两个 repo 都 clone 下来
To follow along, clone both repositories,

19
00:01:06,328 --> 00:01:09,569
让 Docker 一直开着，再腾出大约 10 GB
keep Docker running, and free about 10 gigabytes.

20
00:01:09,889 --> 00:01:12,897
你的 Google 密钥只在聊天的回答上用得到
Your Google key matters only for the chat answers.

21
00:01:13,133 --> 00:01:18,741
角落里的进度条标出 README 的哪一步，代码面板标出文件和行号
The tracker in the corner names the README step, code panels name their file and lines,

22
00:01:18,741 --> 00:01:22,093
黄色的 your turn 标签表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and a yellow tag, your turn, means pause and run it.

23
00:01:22,633 --> 00:01:24,425
先看这一讲在哪儿
First, where this lecture sits.

24
00:01:24,745 --> 00:01:28,293
课程项目已经有了它的机器学习 pipeline
The course project has its machine learning pipeline;

25
00:01:28,293 --> 00:01:32,510
还缺的是应用：一个后端 API 和一个前端
what is still missing is the app: a backend API and a frontend.

26
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:38,617
课上把系统画成一张技术架构图，也就是蓝图，一层一层地画
The lecture draws the system as a technical architecture, the blueprint, one layer at a time.

27
00:01:38,937 --> 00:01:43,382
开发者、用户、GitHub 和 Colab 在云外
Developers, users, GitHub and Colab sit outside the cloud,

28
00:01:43,382 --> 00:01:48,899
Vertex AI 在云里，每个箭头都标着它的协议和 port
Vertex AI inside, and every arrow is labeled with its protocol and port.

29
00:01:49,133 --> 00:01:50,343
接着是一个 bucket
Then come a bucket,

30
00:01:50,343 --> 00:01:53,080
一个存 image 的 registry 和一块持久化磁盘
a registry of images and a persistent disk.

31
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:58,912
右边是一个集群：最前面是 NGINX，应用在 3000
On the right sits a cluster: NGINX in front, the app on 3000,

32
00:01:58,912 --> 00:02:02,978
API 在 9000，向量数据库在 8000
the API on 9000, the vector database on 8000.

33
00:02:03,216 --> 00:02:06,608
今天，整个右半边都在你的笔记本上跑
Today, that whole right-hand side runs on your laptop.

34
00:02:07,166 --> 00:02:10,716
课上的目录规则：每个应用一个 Git 目录
The lecture's folder rule: one Git folder per app,

35
00:02:10,716 --> 00:02:15,614
src 下每个服务一个目录，secrets 放在 Git 目录之外
one folder per service under src, and secrets outside the Git folder.

36
00:02:15,934 --> 00:02:20,917
v1 甚至留着空目录，给它不跑的服务
Version 1 even keeps empty folders for the services it does not run;

37
00:02:20,917 --> 00:02:23,188
v2 只放它自己的三个
version 2 holds only its three.

38
00:02:23,433 --> 00:02:26,462
第 1、2 步：把两个 repo 都 clone 下来
Steps 1 and 2: clone both repositories.

39
00:02:26,782 --> 00:02:30,686
README 写的是 clone 或下载，git clone 是我们的写法
The READMEs say clone or download; git clone is our spelling.

40
00:02:31,006 --> 00:02:32,583
暂停一下，clone 下来
Pause and clone them.

41
00:02:32,633 --> 00:02:34,456
第 3 步：在 clone 旁边
Step 3: next to the clones,

42
00:02:34,456 --> 00:02:37,561
自己建好 secrets 和 persistent-folder 两个目录
create secrets and persistent-folder yourself.

43
00:02:37,881 --> 00:02:39,465
交给 Linux 上的 Docker 去建
Left to Docker on Linux,

44
00:02:39,465 --> 00:02:43,086
它们会属于 root，container 就没法往里写
they would belong to root, and the container could not write there.

45
00:02:43,406 --> 00:02:46,201
你的 ml-workflow.json 密钥放进 secrets 目录里
Your ml-workflow key goes into secrets.

46
00:02:46,450 --> 00:02:51,911
有一件事在我们录制当天变了：v2 的 main 分支动了两次
One thing changed on the day we recorded: the main branch of version 2 moved twice.

47
00:02:52,231 --> 00:02:54,470
我们跟着你今天 clone 到的 main 分支走
We follow main as you clone it today.

48
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:57,075
课上讲的简单前端
The simple frontend the lecture

49
00:02:57,075 --> 00:03:02,130
现在在 2025 分支上，我们最后会去看
teaches now sits on a branch called 2025, which we visit at the end.

50
00:03:04,367 --> 00:03:07,972
浏览器发出一个请求，服务器回一个响应
A browser sends a request; a server sends a response.

51
00:03:08,292 --> 00:03:10,811
由 port 决定交给哪个程序
A port picks which program gets it:

52
00:03:10,811 --> 00:03:15,070
公开网站在地址里省掉默认的 80 和 443
public sites leave the default 80 and 443 out of the address;

53
00:03:15,070 --> 00:03:16,670
我们的地址会写出 port
ours show the port.

54
00:03:16,817 --> 00:03:21,916
在这门课里，API 指的是 REST API，用 FastAPI 来写
In this course, an API means a REST API, built with FastAPI.

55
00:03:22,236 --> 00:03:24,714
每个客户端都只和这一个 API 打交道
Every client talks to that one API,

56
00:03:24,714 --> 00:03:27,334
也只有 API 和各个存储打交道
and only the API talks to the stores.

57
00:03:27,584 --> 00:03:29,739
第 1 部分，cheese-app-v1
Part 1, cheese-app-v1.

58
00:03:30,059 --> 00:03:32,372
第 1 步：进到 API 目录
Step 1: go to the API folder;

59
00:03:32,372 --> 00:03:35,883
README 的路径漏了 src，所以这一步会失败
the README's path misses src, so this fails.

60
00:03:36,203 --> 00:03:38,314
有一个小疏漏：加上 src
A small slip: add src.

61
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,731
第 2 步：sh docker-shell.sh
Step 2: sh docker-shell.sh.

62
00:03:42,051 --> 00:03:47,533
它先构建 image，再启动一个退出时自动删除的 container
It builds the image, then starts a container that removes itself on exit,

63
00:03:47,533 --> 00:03:51,288
挂载你的代码，并把 port 9000 发布到 9000
mounts your code, and publishes port 9000 to 9000.

64
00:03:51,608 --> 00:03:52,950
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

65
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,816
第 3 步：README 里那条长长的 uvicorn 命令
Step 3: the README's long uvicorn line.

66
00:03:56,136 --> 00:04:00,936
这里 uvicorn 是服务器：port 归它管，HTTP 协议也由它来处理
Here, uvicorn is the server: it owns the port and speaks HTTP.

67
00:04:01,256 --> 00:04:03,539
FastAPI 是它里面的应用
FastAPI is the app inside it.

68
00:04:03,784 --> 00:04:07,661
这个 api.service:app 是一个地址
The phrase api.service:app is an address:

69
00:04:07,661 --> 00:04:11,634
api 目录，service.py 文件，app 变量
folder api, file service.py, variable app.

70
00:04:11,884 --> 00:04:15,014
参数 --host 0.0.0.0 表示所有网络接口
--host 0.0.0.0 means every interface:

71
00:04:15,014 --> 00:04:17,468
container 自己的回环地址
the container's own loopback,

72
00:04:17,468 --> 00:04:21,868
还有它的网络接口，也就是隧道到达的地方
and its network interface, where the tunnel arrives.

73
00:04:22,188 --> 00:04:25,932
参数 --reload 在 api 目录里有文件改动时重启应用
--reload restarts the app when a file in api changes;

74
00:04:25,932 --> 00:04:28,758
最后那部分把额外的参数往下传
the last part passes on extra arguments.

75
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:33,072
日志也对得上：0.0.0.0，port 9000
The log agrees: 0.0.0.0, port 9000,

76
00:04:33,072 --> 00:04:37,960
一个监视 api 目录的重载器，startup complete
a reloader watching api, startup complete.

77
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:41,312
在 service.py 里，应用加了 CORS 中间件
In service.py, the app adds CORS middleware,

78
00:04:41,312 --> 00:04:46,264
这个到最后才用得上，还有一个路由：GET / 返回一句欢迎语
which matters at the very end, and one route: GET / returns a welcome.

79
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:49,401
第 4 步：打开 localhost:9000
Step 4: open localhost:9000.

80
00:04:49,721 --> 00:04:52,344
额外用 curl 也能看到同样的回答
An extra curl shows the same reply:

81
00:04:52,344 --> 00:04:55,417
uvicorn 返回状态码 200，还有那句欢迎语
status 200 from uvicorn, and the welcome.

82
00:04:55,737 --> 00:04:57,117
暂停一下，试一试
Pause and try it.

83
00:04:57,167 --> 00:05:00,820
这就是课上的那一趟：转发到发布的 port
That is the lecture's trip: forwarded to the published port,

84
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:05,082
映射进 container，函数运行，JSON 再传回来
mapped into the container, the function runs, and the JSON comes back.

85
00:05:05,934 --> 00:05:11,929
提一句：课件把 container 内部标成 localhost:9000
One kind note: the slide labels the inside of the container localhost:9000.

86
00:05:12,249 --> 00:05:16,751
把它理解成 container 的 port 9000 就好
Take it as port 9000 of the container:

87
00:05:16,751 --> 00:05:19,950
uvicorn 监听的是 0.0.0.0
uvicorn listens on 0.0.0.0.

88
00:05:20,184 --> 00:05:21,784
那么，快速测一下
So, a quick test.

89
00:05:21,848 --> 00:05:25,624
如果 uvicorn 改成监听 127.0.0.1
If uvicorn listened on 127.0.0.1 instead,

90
00:05:25,624 --> 00:05:29,677
在 container 里面用 curl 还能通吗？
would a curl from inside the container work?

91
00:05:29,997 --> 00:05:32,642
那你浏览器里的 localhost:9000 呢？
And your browser on localhost:9000?

92
00:05:42,583 --> 00:05:46,146
在 container 里面，可以：它自己的回环地址会应答
Inside, yes: the container's own loopback answers.

93
00:05:46,466 --> 00:05:47,762
从浏览器，不行
From the browser, no:

94
00:05:47,762 --> 00:05:51,842
转发过来的请求到达的是 container 的网络接口
the forwarded request arrives on the container's network interface,

95
00:05:51,842 --> 00:05:53,442
而那里没人监听
where nothing listens.

96
00:05:53,506 --> 00:05:58,114
这就是 README 写 0.0.0.0 的原因
That is why the README says 0.0.0.0.

97
00:05:58,350 --> 00:06:02,702
第 5 步：课上把一个路由写成加了装饰器的 Python 函数
Step 5: the lecture writes a route as a decorated Python function.

98
00:06:03,022 --> 00:06:05,401
把 README 里的 square root 函数
Add the README's square_root function

99
00:06:05,401 --> 00:06:07,651
加到 service.py 末尾，保存
at the end of service.py, and save.

100
00:06:07,971 --> 00:06:11,342
它返回 x 的平方加 y 的平方再开平方根
It returns the square root of x squared plus y squared.

101
00:06:11,583 --> 00:06:16,362
在服务器的终端里，StatReload 发现了改动，换上一个新的应用
In the server's terminal, StatReload sees the change and swaps in a fresh app.

102
00:06:16,682 --> 00:06:18,282
你什么都没重启
You restarted nothing.

103
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:21,593
第 6 步：打开 square root，带上结尾的斜杠
Step 6: open square_root, with its trailing slash.

104
00:06:21,913 --> 00:06:26,479
没有参数，所以用默认值 1 和 2：5 的平方根
No arguments, so the defaults 1 and 2 apply: the square root of 5.

105
00:06:26,799 --> 00:06:28,399
暂停一下，试一试
Pause and try it.

106
00:06:28,483 --> 00:06:31,854
第 7 步：加上 x 等于 2，y 等于 10
Step 7: add x=2&y=10.

107
00:06:32,174 --> 00:06:38,168
查询字符串填进函数的参数，返回的是 104 的平方根
The query string fills the function's arguments, and back comes the square root of 104.

108
00:06:38,416 --> 00:06:39,753
两个额外实验
Two extras.

109
00:06:39,803 --> 00:06:44,923
用字母代替数字，会撞上 float 类型提示，被 422 弹回来
A letter instead of a number bounces off the float type hint with 422.

110
00:06:45,166 --> 00:06:51,460
不带结尾的斜杠，FastAPI 会返回 307，指向带斜杠的版本
Without the trailing slash, FastAPI answers 307 and points to the slash version.

111
00:06:51,700 --> 00:06:54,751
服务器日志列出每个请求和它的状态码
The server's log shows each request with its status.

112
00:06:55,071 --> 00:07:00,126
200、200、200、422、307
200, 200, 200, 422, 307.

113
00:07:00,516 --> 00:07:02,585
第 8 步：打开 /docs
Step 8: open /docs.

114
00:07:02,905 --> 00:07:05,627
FastAPI 从你的代码生成了这个页面
FastAPI built this page from your code:

115
00:07:05,627 --> 00:07:11,418
x 和 y 显示为数字，带着默认值，你还能直接在这里试一次调用
x and y appear as numbers, with their defaults, and you can try a call right there.

116
00:07:11,666 --> 00:07:15,293
类型提示变成了校验，也变成了文档
The type hints became the validation and the documentation.

117
00:07:15,613 --> 00:07:18,301
暂停一下，在文档页上试一次调用
Pause and try one call from the docs page.

118
00:07:19,650 --> 00:07:22,423
现在是 v1 的另一半：一个页面
Now the other half of version 1: a page.

119
00:07:22,743 --> 00:07:24,708
课上把一个页面拆成三块
The lecture splits a page

120
00:07:24,708 --> 00:07:29,975
HTML 管结构，CSS 管样式，JavaScript 管行为
into HTML for structure, CSS for style and JavaScript for behavior.

121
00:07:30,295 --> 00:07:33,922
在 v1 里，index.html 把三样都链接起来
In version 1, index.html links all three.

122
00:07:34,167 --> 00:07:36,492
第 1 步：进到前端目录
Step 1: go to the frontend folder.

123
00:07:36,812 --> 00:07:39,457
和前面同样的疏漏：加上 src
Same slip as before: add src.

124
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:43,783
第 2、3 步：暂停一下，运行 sh docker-shell.sh
Steps 2 and 3: pause, run sh docker-shell.sh,

125
00:07:43,783 --> 00:07:47,231
然后在 container 里跑 http-server
then http-server inside the container.

126
00:07:47,551 --> 00:07:51,348
它在 port 8080 上提供这个目录，缓存时间一小时
It serves this folder on port 8080, with a one-hour cache.

127
00:07:51,668 --> 00:07:56,703
它打印的地址都在 container 里面；你的笔记本用 8080
The addresses it prints are inside the container; your laptop uses 8080.

128
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:59,745
第 4 步：打开 localhost:8080
Step 4: open localhost:8080.

129
00:08:00,065 --> 00:08:04,673
这是课上的第一趟：请求到达 http-server
This is the lecture's first trip: the request reaches http-server,

130
00:08:04,673 --> 00:08:07,745
传回一个文件，浏览器把它画出来
a file comes back, and the browser draws it.

131
00:08:08,065 --> 00:08:09,665
暂停一下，打开看看
Pause and open it.

132
00:08:16,883 --> 00:08:21,046
额外看一眼 main.js：这些播客是示例数据
An extra look at main.js: the podcasts are sample data,

133
00:08:21,046 --> 00:08:23,923
正常情况下应该来自一个 API
which would normally come from an API.

134
00:08:24,243 --> 00:08:26,227
第 2 部分会加上第二趟
Part 2 adds that second trip.

135
00:08:26,467 --> 00:08:29,944
第 5 步：在 index.html 里加一个段落
Step 5: add a paragraph to index.html.

136
00:08:30,264 --> 00:08:33,837
说明一点：README 里的代码片段是一个旧的完整 body
A small note: the README's snippet is an old whole body,

137
00:08:33,837 --> 00:08:37,283
贴进去会把页面和它的 script 标签都弄丢
and pasting it would drop the page and its script tag.

138
00:08:37,603 --> 00:08:39,203
只加那个段落
Add only the paragraph.

139
00:08:43,017 --> 00:08:46,004
第 6 步：刷新，新文字就出来了
Step 6: refresh, and the new text appears.

140
00:08:46,324 --> 00:08:49,625
改了 main.js 可能需要强制刷新
Edits to main.js may need a hard refresh,

141
00:08:49,625 --> 00:08:54,537
因为 http-server 让浏览器把文件缓存一小时
because http-server lets the browser cache files for an hour.

142
00:08:54,783 --> 00:08:58,794
要收尾，在两个终端里都按 Ctrl-C，再输入 exit
To clean up, press Ctrl+C and type exit in both terminals.

143
00:08:59,114 --> 00:09:03,210
这时 container 列表是空的，因为两个都自己删掉了
The container list is then empty, because both removed themselves.

144
00:09:05,583 --> 00:09:08,792
命令 docker system prune 会先问你，所以输入 y 确认
docker system prune asks first, so type y;

145
00:09:08,792 --> 00:09:11,237
image 列表显示留下了什么
the image list shows what stays.

146
00:09:13,083 --> 00:09:15,120
现在是 v2，真正的应用
Now version 2, the real app:

147
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,883
四个 container，在同一个 Docker 网络上
four containers on one Docker network.

148
00:09:18,203 --> 00:09:21,700
Chroma，也就是向量数据库，在 8000
Chroma, the vector database, on 8000;

149
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:23,307
一个加载器
a loader; the API

150
00:09:23,307 --> 00:09:26,992
API 在 9000；React 前端在 3000
on 9000; and the React frontend on 3000.

151
00:09:27,233 --> 00:09:32,405
前置条件：一个启用了 Vertex AI API 的 Google Cloud 项目
The prerequisites: a Google Cloud project with the Vertex AI API,

152
00:09:32,405 --> 00:09:36,304
一个带 Vertex AI User 角色的 ml-workflow 密钥
the ml-workflow key with the Vertex AI User role,

153
00:09:36,304 --> 00:09:38,134
还有大约 10 GB
and about 10 gigabytes.

154
00:09:38,454 --> 00:09:41,953
有了你的密钥，聊天和 embedding 调用会向你的项目计费
With your key, chat and embedding calls bill your project.

155
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:47,853
如实说一句：我们录制用的密钥文件格式正确，但不属于任何账号
One honest note: our recording's key file is well-formed but belongs to no account.

156
00:09:48,173 --> 00:09:52,044
凡是不调用 Google 的，都和你那边完全一样
Everything that does not call Google works exactly as for you;

157
00:09:52,044 --> 00:09:54,978
第一次 Google 调用会失败，我们会指给你看在哪儿
the first Google call fails, and we show where.

158
00:09:55,216 --> 00:09:59,760
最后一步设置：把你的项目 ID 填进两个 docker-shell 脚本
Last setup step: put your project ID into both docker-shell scripts.

159
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,808
我们这里显示的是一个占位符
Ours shows a placeholder.

160
00:10:02,050 --> 00:10:05,869
课上的第一步：确保向量数据库在跑
The lecture's first step: make sure the vector database is running.

161
00:10:06,189 --> 00:10:11,778
第 1 步：进到 src/vector-db，运行 docker-shell.sh
Step 1: cd src/vector-db, and run docker-shell.sh.

162
00:10:12,098 --> 00:10:13,550
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run them.

163
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:18,691
这个脚本创建网络，构建加载器，再由 Compose 启动 Chroma
The script creates the network, builds the loader, and Compose starts Chroma,

164
00:10:18,691 --> 00:10:22,922
发布 8000，把数据存在你笔记本上的一个目录里
publishing 8000 and keeping its data in a folder on your laptop.

165
00:10:23,450 --> 00:10:27,546
第 2 步，在 container 里：下载并加载奶酪书
Step 2, inside the container: download and load the cheese books.

166
00:10:27,866 --> 00:10:34,010
一共 11 个文件，每本书一行完成信息，总共 14,356 个 chunk
Eleven files, one finished line per book, 14,356 chunks in all.

167
00:10:34,330 --> 00:10:35,930
暂停一下，等你的加载完
Pause while yours loads.

168
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:39,342
这些就是 RAG 那一讲的 chunk 和 embedding
These are the RAG lecture's chunks and embeddings,

169
00:10:39,342 --> 00:10:41,092
是下载来的，不是重新算的
downloaded, not recomputed.

170
00:10:41,450 --> 00:10:42,979
第 3 步：chat
Step 3: chat.

171
00:10:43,029 --> 00:10:45,796
第一次 Google 调用，也就是给问题做 embedding
The first Google call, embedding the question,

172
00:10:45,796 --> 00:10:48,974
在这里失败了，报错是：Invalid grant: account not found
fails here: Invalid grant: account not found.

173
00:10:49,109 --> 00:10:53,360
有了你的密钥，这里出现的就是一个来自这些书的回答。说明一点
With your key, an answer from the books appears instead. A small note:

174
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:57,368
chat 总是问它自己固定的那个问题，How is cheese made
chat always asks its own fixed question, "How is cheese made?",

175
00:10:57,368 --> 00:10:59,658
没有地方让你输入自己的问题
and there is no place to type yours.

176
00:10:59,978 --> 00:11:03,434
想问别的，就改 cli.py 里的那一行
To ask another, edit that line in cli.py.

177
00:11:03,683 --> 00:11:05,283
第 4 步：exit
Step 4: exit.

178
00:11:05,539 --> 00:11:09,576
Chroma 还在 8000 上跑着，额外跑一次 docker ps 就能看到
Chroma keeps running on 8000, as an extra docker ps shows,

179
00:11:09,576 --> 00:11:14,030
网络的电话簿现在也能把它的名字解析成地址
and the network's phone book now turns its name into an address.

180
00:11:16,450 --> 00:11:18,050
Backend APIs
Backend APIs.

181
00:11:18,135 --> 00:11:22,720
在一个新终端里，从 cheese-app-v2 目录开始
In a new terminal, from the cheese-app-v2 folder:

182
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:27,586
第 1 步，进到 src/api-service，运行 docker-shell.sh
step 1, cd src/api-service, and run docker-shell.sh.

183
00:11:27,906 --> 00:11:29,672
第一次构建要一阵子
The first build takes a while,

184
00:11:29,672 --> 00:11:32,322
因为有 TensorFlow，所以暂停一下，先把它跑起来
because of TensorFlow, so pause and start it.

185
00:11:32,567 --> 00:11:36,535
横幅给了两个命令：API server 和 pytest
The banner offers two commands: api_server and pytest.

186
00:11:36,783 --> 00:11:38,307
这个脚本会先检查
This script checks first:

187
00:11:38,307 --> 00:11:41,903
如果 container 已经在跑，就直接在里面开一个 shell
if the container already runs, it just opens a shell in it.

188
00:11:42,223 --> 00:11:45,572
否则，它以只读方式挂载 secrets
Otherwise it mounts secrets without write access,

189
00:11:45,572 --> 00:11:50,287
挂载你的 persistent-folder，发布 9000，再加入网络
mounts your persistent-folder, publishes 9000, and joins the network.

190
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:52,827
第 2 步：API server
Step 2: api_server.

191
00:11:53,147 --> 00:11:59,227
它和前面那条 uvicorn 命令几乎一样，指向 api.service:app
It is almost the same uvicorn line as before, pointing at api.service:app.

192
00:11:59,547 --> 00:12:01,000
暂停一下，把它启动起来
Pause and start it.

193
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:03,930
Application startup complete 马上就出现了
Application startup complete arrives at once.

194
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:06,984
在它之后，TensorFlow 的输出才出现
Only after it do TensorFlow's lines appear,

195
00:12:06,984 --> 00:12:10,671
来自一个加载奶酪分类器的后台线程
from a background thread that loads the cheese classifier.

196
00:12:10,917 --> 00:12:15,546
这就是设计：模型在加载的时候，API 已经马上能应答
That is the design: the API answers right away while the model loads.

197
00:12:15,866 --> 00:12:19,770
有两个探针告诉你进行到哪一步了：/healthz 和 /readyz
Two probes say how far along it is: /healthz and /readyz.

198
00:12:21,133 --> 00:12:25,208
第 3 步：/healthz 返回 200：进程还活着
Step 3: /healthz says 200: the process is alive.

199
00:12:25,528 --> 00:12:29,069
而 /readyz 返回 503，CNN model is loading
/readyz says 503, CNN model is loading.

200
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:38,920
额外看一眼：模型只下载一次，存进你的 persistent-folder
An extra look: the model is downloaded once into your persistent-folder,

201
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:40,607
以后每次启动都复用它
and every start reuses it.

202
00:12:41,350 --> 00:12:44,123
再一个额外实验：v1 的习惯不管用了
Another extra: the version 1 habits fail.

203
00:12:44,443 --> 00:12:46,392
根路径 / 和 /docs 都返回 404
/ and /docs answer 404;

204
00:12:46,392 --> 00:12:53,254
浏览器调用的一切都在 /api 下面，只有探针还留在根路径
everything the browser calls is under /api, and only the probes stay at the root.

205
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:04,100
那么，快速测一下
So, a quick test.

206
00:13:04,164 --> 00:13:07,791
现在 /healthz 返回 200，/readyz 返回 503
/healthz says 200 and /readyz says 503.

207
00:13:08,111 --> 00:13:10,265
你是重启 container，还是等一等？
Do you restart the container, or wait?

208
00:13:19,100 --> 00:13:22,747
等：大约 9 秒后，/readyz 返回 200
Wait: about nine seconds later, /readyz says 200:

209
00:13:22,747 --> 00:13:25,649
模型加载好了，Chroma 也有应答
the model is loaded and Chroma answers.

210
00:13:25,969 --> 00:13:28,529
重启只会让加载从头再来
A restart would only start the loading over.

211
00:13:28,849 --> 00:13:32,452
Kubernetes，你会在第 19 讲和第 22 讲里见到
Kubernetes, which you meet in lectures 19 and 22,

212
00:13:32,452 --> 00:13:38,407
正好可以用这两个探针：看存活决定重启，看就绪决定放流量
can use exactly these two probes: restart on liveness, send traffic on readiness.

213
00:13:39,650 --> 00:13:41,677
API 需要哪些路由？
Which routes does the API need?

214
00:13:41,997 --> 00:13:47,565
课上从页面出发：简报、播客，还有一个能接收照片的聊天
The lecture starts from the screens: newsletters, podcasts, and a chat that takes a photo.

215
00:13:47,885 --> 00:13:52,151
每个页面都需要数据，每一类数据就变成一组路由
Each screen needs data, and each kind of data becomes a group of routes.

216
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:58,181
在 service.py 里，简报和播客在 /api 下各有一个 router
In service.py, newsletters and podcasts get a router each under /api.

217
00:13:58,501 --> 00:14:01,859
然后由一个函数批量生成三个聊天 router
Then one function stamps out three chat routers:

218
00:14:01,859 --> 00:14:04,027
Ask、Identify 和 Cheese books
Ask, Identify and Cheese books.

219
00:14:04,347 --> 00:14:09,339
课上画了六组；agent 聊天在这个 repo 里没有 router
The lecture shows six groups; agent chat has no router in this repository.

220
00:14:09,583 --> 00:14:15,684
课上还画了 agent 可以放的三个位置，有没有 MCP 服务都行
The lecture also shows three places an agent can sit, with or without an MCP service.

221
00:14:16,004 --> 00:14:17,733
这个 repo 一个都没有
This repository has none.

222
00:14:17,967 --> 00:14:20,719
课件上那个单文件路由讲的是思路
And the slide's one-file route is the idea.

223
00:14:21,039 --> 00:14:24,909
这个 repo 把同一个函数放进一个 router
The repository puts the same function in a router,

224
00:14:24,909 --> 00:14:27,076
挂在 /api/newsletters 下
mounted at /api/newsletters.

225
00:14:27,317 --> 00:14:31,413
演示路由：把 README 里的函数加在 get status 后面，保存
Demo route: add the README's function after get_status, and save.

226
00:14:31,733 --> 00:14:33,631
服务器会自己重载
The server reloads by itself.

227
00:14:35,050 --> 00:14:39,914
这会再加载一次模型，过一会儿 /readyz 又回到 200
This loads the model again, and /readyz is back to 200 shortly after.

228
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:44,481
然后打开 /api 下的 square root：又是 5 的平方根
Then open /api/square_root: the square root of 5 again.

229
00:14:44,801 --> 00:14:49,387
用 x 等于 3，y 等于 4，它返回 5.0
With x=3&y=4, it answers 5.0.

230
00:14:49,707 --> 00:14:51,267
暂停一下，两个都试试
Pause and try both.

231
00:14:51,317 --> 00:14:54,901
API 文档：搬到了 /api/docs
API docs: they moved to /api/docs.

232
00:14:55,221 --> 00:15:00,106
额外列一下，能看到全部 25 个操作：就是这棵树的叶子
An extra listing shows all 25 operations: the leaves of this tree.

233
00:15:00,883 --> 00:15:04,531
在文档页里，暂停一下，试试 get newsletters，limit 设成 2
In the docs, pause and try get newsletters with a limit of 2.

234
00:15:04,851 --> 00:15:10,419
两条简报以 JSON 返回，最新的在前：课上的例子，现在成了真的
Two newsletters come back as JSON, newest first: the lecture's example, now real.

235
00:15:10,739 --> 00:15:14,323
一个不存在的 ID 会得到 404，Newsletter not found
An unknown ID gets 404, newsletter not found.

236
00:15:14,567 --> 00:15:17,767
Review the code：README 的表格逐个对应了每个文件
Review the code: the README's table maps each file.

237
00:15:18,087 --> 00:15:22,236
其中 service.py 构建应用，settings.py 放所有设置
service.py builds the app, settings.py holds every setting,

238
00:15:22,236 --> 00:15:27,580
router 里放路由，每种聊天模式一个 utils 文件来干活
the routers hold the routes, and one utils file per chat mode does the work.

239
00:15:28,117 --> 00:15:32,192
课上的聊天处理函数写着：use Gemini to generate text
The lecture's chat handler says: use Gemini to generate text.

240
00:15:32,512 --> 00:15:36,906
在 repo 里，一个路由开始聊天，另一个路由接着聊
In the repository, one route starts a chat and another continues it.

241
00:15:37,226 --> 00:15:41,749
真实的路径里带着模式：/api/llm/chats
The real path names the mode: /api/llm/chats.

242
00:15:41,984 --> 00:15:44,864
API 是怎么记住一段对话的？
How does the API remember a conversation?

243
00:15:45,184 --> 00:15:49,962
它不记：每发一条消息，浏览器都会带上一个 session ID
It does not: with every message, the browser sends a session ID,

244
00:15:49,962 --> 00:15:52,053
每个浏览器一个随机的 UUID
one random UUID per browser.

245
00:15:52,373 --> 00:15:55,134
API 打开这个 session 的聊天文件
The API opens that session's chat file,

246
00:15:55,134 --> 00:15:58,816
加上你的消息和回复，保存，然后就忘掉
adds your message and the reply, saves, and forgets.

247
00:15:59,050 --> 00:16:04,448
两个额外实验：没有 session ID，或者消息为空，都会得到 422
Two extras: no session ID, or an empty message, gets 422.

248
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,331
Identify 的识图这一步完全离线
Identify's photo step works fully offline.

249
00:16:16,651 --> 00:16:20,230
我们发送 repo 自带的那张蓝纹奶酪照片
We send the repository's own blue cheese photo,

250
00:16:20,230 --> 00:16:23,733
CNN 猜的是 parmigiano，58%
and the CNN guesses parmigiano, at 58 percent.

251
00:16:24,053 --> 00:16:26,720
追问会交给 Gemini
A follow-up question would go to Gemini.

252
00:16:26,967 --> 00:16:29,339
额外列一下，就能在磁盘上看到
An extra listing shows it on disk:

253
00:16:29,339 --> 00:16:32,271
你的 session 下每个聊天一个 JSON 文件
one JSON file per chat under your session,

254
00:16:32,271 --> 00:16:35,202
照片在这个模式的 images 目录里
and the photo in the mode's images folder.

255
00:16:35,484 --> 00:16:38,656
Ask 模式会调用 Gemini，到这里就停了
Ask mode calls Gemini, and here it stops:

256
00:16:38,656 --> 00:16:41,287
Internal Server Error，状态码 500
Internal Server Error, status 500.

257
00:16:41,607 --> 00:16:43,689
API 的终端说明了原因，报错还是那个
The API's terminal shows why:

258
00:16:43,689 --> 00:16:46,705
Invalid grant: account not found
the same Invalid grant: account not found.

259
00:16:47,025 --> 00:16:49,798
有了你的密钥，Gemini 的回答就是这个形状
With your key, Gemini's answer has this shape.

260
00:16:50,034 --> 00:16:51,313
说明一点
A small note:

261
00:16:51,313 --> 00:16:57,415
README 的表格讲的是 Gemini 返回 403 和 404，报成 502
the README's table covers Gemini 403 and 404, reported as 502.

262
00:16:57,735 --> 00:17:01,332
Google 没法用来登录的密钥会更早失败
A key Google cannot sign in with fails earlier,

263
00:17:01,332 --> 00:17:05,159
就是一个普通的 500，所以先看 API 的终端
as a plain 500, so check the API's terminal first.

264
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,000
再补充 README 的两点
Two more README notes.

265
00:17:07,192 --> 00:17:11,252
每条消息都从存下来的文件重建对话
Each message rebuilds the conversation from the saved file,

266
00:17:11,252 --> 00:17:13,592
所以 API 的任何一个副本都能回答
so any copy of the API can answer.

267
00:17:13,912 --> 00:17:16,945
而用普通 def 写的路由在线程里跑
And routes written with plain def run in threads,

268
00:17:16,945 --> 00:17:19,608
所以一个慢的回答不会阻塞其他请求
so one slow answer does not block the rest.

269
00:17:19,850 --> 00:17:21,027
最后是测试
Last, the tests:

270
00:17:21,027 --> 00:17:24,044
在第二个终端里，在同一个目录下再运行 docker-shell.sh
in a second terminal, in the same folder,

271
00:17:24,044 --> 00:17:28,533
会在正在跑的 container 里开一个 shell
docker-shell.sh again opens a shell in the running container.

272
00:17:28,853 --> 00:17:31,221
运行 pytest：26 passed
Run pytest: 26 passed.

273
00:17:31,541 --> 00:17:33,117
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

274
00:17:33,167 --> 00:17:34,810
让这个 container 一直跑着
Keep this container running.

275
00:17:35,130 --> 00:17:39,183
API 已经就绪，但还没人能从浏览器里用它
The API is ready, but nobody can use it from a browser yet.

276
00:17:39,503 --> 00:17:44,922
在第 2 部分，浏览器和 port 3000 说话，那它怎么到达 9000？
In part 2 the browser talks to port 3000, so how does that reach 9000?

277
00:17:46,150 --> 00:17:47,814
第 2 部分：前端
Part 2: the frontend.

278
00:17:48,134 --> 00:17:52,635
API 已经在 port 9000 上跑起来了；现在来做一个用它的页面
The API is up on port 9000; now a page that uses it.

279
00:17:52,883 --> 00:17:56,147
课上从每个功能一个 HTML 页面讲起
The lecture starts with one HTML page per feature.

280
00:17:56,467 --> 00:17:59,430
每个页面都带着自己的页头、脚本和样式
Each carries its own header, script and style;

281
00:17:59,430 --> 00:18:03,294
什么都不共享，每次点击都要加载整个页面：很慢
nothing is shared, and every click loads a whole page: slow.

282
00:18:03,667 --> 00:18:07,784
解决办法是一个用组件搭起来的单页应用，配一个框架
The fix is a single-page app built from components, with a framework.

283
00:18:08,104 --> 00:18:11,112
课上列了常见的几个，选了 React
The lecture names the common ones and picks React.

284
00:18:11,350 --> 00:18:16,513
在 React 里，一个组件就是一个返回标记的函数，用 JSX 来写
In React, a component is a function that returns markup, written in JSX.

285
00:18:16,833 --> 00:18:20,803
整个应用是一个外壳：一个只定义一次的页头
The app is one shell: a header defined only once, a footer,

286
00:18:20,803 --> 00:18:24,235
一个页脚，中间一块随页面变化
and in between a block that changes with each page.

287
00:18:24,483 --> 00:18:27,304
今天的 repo 用的是 React 加 Vite
Today's repository uses React with Vite,

288
00:18:27,304 --> 00:18:31,182
Vite 是开发服务器兼构建工具，再加上 React Router
a development server and build tool, plus React Router.

289
00:18:31,502 --> 00:18:35,547
在 main.jsx 里，一张路由表把每个地址对应到一个页面
In main.jsx, a route table maps each address to a page,

290
00:18:35,547 --> 00:18:38,563
还有一个兜住其余一切的星号
with a star that catches everything else.

291
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:42,115
在 App.jsx 里，页头和页脚只写一次
In App.jsx, the header and footer are written once,

292
00:18:42,115 --> 00:18:47,056
中间是 outlet，也就是显示当前页面的那扇窗口
and between them sits the outlet, the window where the current page appears.

293
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:52,730
React 前端设置，在一个新终端里，从 cheese-app-v2 目录开始
React setup, in a new terminal from the cheese-app-v2 folder:

294
00:18:52,730 --> 00:18:57,625
第 1 步，进到 src/frontend-react，运行 docker-shell.sh
step 1, cd src/frontend-react, and run docker-shell.sh.

295
00:18:57,945 --> 00:19:02,645
它挂载你的代码，把 node modules 放在一个命名的 volume 里
It mounts your code, keeps node_modules in a named volume,

296
00:19:02,645 --> 00:19:06,777
把 3000 发布到 port 5173，再加入网络
publishes 3000 to port 5173, and joins the network.

297
00:19:07,097 --> 00:19:08,433
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

298
00:19:08,483 --> 00:19:10,680
横幅显示了 Node 和 npm
The banner shows Node and npm.

299
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:16,782
你第一次运行时会把依赖装进这个 volume；我们的已经是最新的了
Your first run installs the dependencies into the volume; ours was already up to date.

300
00:19:17,017 --> 00:19:19,214
第 2 步：npm run dev
Step 2: npm run dev.

301
00:19:19,534 --> 00:19:23,554
Vite 就绪了，打印出 5173 上的两个地址
Vite is ready and prints two addresses on 5173;

302
00:19:23,554 --> 00:19:28,601
两个都在 container 里面，所以在你的笔记本上，用 3000
both are inside the container, so on your laptop, use 3000.

303
00:19:28,921 --> 00:19:30,367
暂停一下，把它启动起来
Pause and start it.

304
00:19:30,417 --> 00:19:33,212
第 3 步：打开 localhost:3000
Step 3: open localhost:3000.

305
00:19:33,532 --> 00:19:37,683
HTML 几乎是空的：一个叫 root 的 div
The HTML is almost empty: one div called root

306
00:19:37,683 --> 00:19:39,804
再加一个脚本，main.jsx
and a script, main.jsx.

307
00:19:40,124 --> 00:19:43,110
整个应用就是一个页面加上它的 JavaScript
The whole app is one page and its JavaScript.

308
00:19:43,350 --> 00:19:49,515
一个额外检查：每个地址，哪怕是不存在的，都返回同样的 HTML
An extra check: every address, even one that does not exist, returns the same HTML.

309
00:19:49,835 --> 00:19:52,417
挑页面的是浏览器，不是服务器
The browser picks the page, not the server.

310
00:19:55,383 --> 00:19:56,983
现在来回答开头的问题
Now the hook's answer.

311
00:19:57,090 --> 00:20:00,631
在课上，页面的 JavaScript 调用 API
In the lecture, the page's JavaScript calls the API.

312
00:20:00,951 --> 00:20:03,733
在这里，api.js 里的每一次调用都发往
Here, every call in api.js goes

313
00:20:03,733 --> 00:20:07,142
一个以 /api 开头的相对路径
to a relative path starting with /api,

314
00:20:07,142 --> 00:20:10,551
带上 localStorage 里的 session ID
with the session ID from localStorage.

315
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:14,301
而 vite.config.js 里放着那个信使
And vite.config.js holds the courier:

316
00:20:14,301 --> 00:20:15,501
一条代理规则
a proxy rule

317
00:20:15,501 --> 00:20:20,798
把 /api 转发到 cheese-app-api-service 的 port 9000
that forwards /api to cheese-app-api-service, port 9000,

318
00:20:20,798 --> 00:20:22,512
按的是 container 名字
by container name.

319
00:20:22,983 --> 00:20:26,546
所以浏览器只和 localhost:3000 说话
So the browser only ever talks to localhost:3000.

320
00:20:26,866 --> 00:20:32,476
Vite 在前端的 container 里，把每个 /api 请求经网络送过去
Vite, in the frontend container, carries each /api request across the network.

321
00:20:32,796 --> 00:20:35,698
这就是 uvicorn 在 3000 上应答的原因
That is why uvicorn answered on 3000.

322
00:20:35,933 --> 00:20:38,898
一个 origin 就是协议、主机和 port 三样合在一起
An origin is the scheme, the host and the port.

323
00:20:39,218 --> 00:20:42,458
页面和它的 API 调用同属一个 origin
The page and its API calls share one origin,

324
00:20:42,458 --> 00:20:48,200
所以浏览器没什么好拦的，API 也不需要许可条
so the browser has nothing to object to, and the API needs no permission slip.

325
00:20:48,450 --> 00:20:50,050
那么，快速测一下
So, a quick test.

326
00:20:50,114 --> 00:20:54,715
页面的 JavaScript 能不能按 container 名字调用 API
Could the page's JavaScript call the API by its container name,

327
00:20:54,715 --> 00:20:56,315
用 port 9000，直接调？
port 9000, directly?

328
00:21:05,050 --> 00:21:09,664
不能。这段 JavaScript 跑在你的浏览器里，也就是笔记本上
No. The JavaScript runs in your browser, on the laptop,

329
00:21:09,664 --> 00:21:12,901
而笔记本的 DNS 不认识任何 container 名字
and the laptop's DNS knows no container names.

330
00:21:13,221 --> 00:21:19,130
只有网络里面的代码才能用这些名字：Vite 代理、nginx、API
Only code inside the network can use them: the Vite proxy, nginx, the API.

331
00:21:19,366 --> 00:21:24,273
一个额外实验：把 API 从网络上断开，只为了一个请求
An extra experiment: unplug the API from the network for one request.

332
00:21:24,593 --> 00:21:27,515
浏览器拿到 502，响应体是空的
The browser gets 502 with an empty body:

333
00:21:27,515 --> 00:21:31,825
正是 README 故障排查表里，页面加载出来是空白的那一行
the README's troubleshooting row for pages that load empty.

334
00:21:32,066 --> 00:21:36,660
Review the app：首页、播客和简报都经过 API 加载
Review the app: home, podcasts and newsletters load through the API,

335
00:21:36,660 --> 00:21:40,173
Recent 标签页在刷新后还留着你的聊天
and the Recent tab keeps your chats across a reload.

336
00:21:40,493 --> 00:21:43,447
在聊天里，Identify 经过代理能用
In chat, Identify works through the proxy;

337
00:21:43,447 --> 00:21:48,087
Ask，还有问 Tolminc 的 Cheese books，都得到同样的 500
Ask, and Cheese books with its Tolminc question, get the same 500.

338
00:21:48,407 --> 00:21:49,950
暂停一下，挨个点一遍
Pause and click through.

339
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:54,715
README 的代码表列出了我们刚看过的文件；暂停一下，逐个对上
The README's code table names the files we just saw; pause to match each one.

340
00:21:55,035 --> 00:21:58,444
然后在第二个终端里，在同一个目录下再运行 docker-shell.sh
Then, in a second terminal in the same folder,

341
00:21:58,444 --> 00:22:02,798
会在正在跑的 container 里开一个 shell
docker-shell.sh again opens a shell in the running container;

342
00:22:02,798 --> 00:22:04,298
在里面跑 npm run check
run npm run check:

343
00:22:04,298 --> 00:22:07,707
一次 lint、一次格式检查和一次生产构建
a lint, a format check and a production build.

344
00:22:08,027 --> 00:22:10,160
生产环境提供的就是这次构建的结果
That build is what production serves.

345
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:17,011
在生产环境里，Vite 不运行，那由谁来提供文件、转发 /api？
In production, Vite does not run, so who serves the files and forwards /api?

346
00:22:17,331 --> 00:22:18,902
是 nginx
Nginx does.

347
00:22:18,952 --> 00:22:22,557
今天的 README 在录制当天删掉了这一节
Today's README dropped this section on the recording day,

348
00:22:22,557 --> 00:22:24,581
但它的文件还在 main 分支里
but its files are still in main,

349
00:22:24,581 --> 00:22:27,997
所以我们照早一版 README 的命令跑，标成 extra
so we run the earlier README's commands, marked extra.

350
00:22:28,233 --> 00:22:30,836
生产用的 Dockerfile 分两个阶段
The production Dockerfile has two stages.

351
00:22:31,156 --> 00:22:33,054
第一阶段用 Node 构建应用
The first builds the app with Node.

352
00:22:33,374 --> 00:22:37,577
第二阶段从 nginx 开始，只拷进构建好的文件
The second starts from nginx and copies in only the built files.

353
00:22:37,817 --> 00:22:41,758
这个 nginx 模板里有和 Vite 一样的规则
The nginx template has the same rule as Vite:

354
00:22:41,758 --> 00:22:44,473
/api 交给 API 的 container
/api goes to the API container.

355
00:22:44,793 --> 00:22:50,731
其他任何页面地址都返回 index.html，好让 router 来挑页面
Any other page address gets index.html, so the router can choose the page;

356
00:22:50,731 --> 00:22:53,539
只有缺失的静态资源才是真正的 404
only a missing asset is a real 404.

357
00:22:53,783 --> 00:22:56,588
用 Ctrl-C 停掉开发服务器并 exit
Stop the dev server with Ctrl+C and exit,

358
00:22:56,588 --> 00:22:59,735
然后构建生产 image，打上 prod 这个 tag
then build the production image, tagged :prod.

359
00:23:00,055 --> 00:23:03,426
它的第一阶段跑的就是你刚检查过的那次 Vite 构建
Its first stage runs the same Vite build you just checked.

360
00:23:03,667 --> 00:23:07,422
在网络上运行它，把 8080 发布到 port 80
Run it on the network, publishing 8080 to port 80.

361
00:23:07,742 --> 00:23:11,767
打开 localhost:8080：服务器现在是 nginx
Open localhost:8080: the server is now nginx,

362
00:23:11,767 --> 00:23:17,491
/api 还能到达 API，深层链接也照样拿到页面
/api still reaches the API, and a deep link still gets the page.

363
00:23:17,733 --> 00:23:24,560
比较一下大小：开发 image 331 MB，生产的大约 95
Compare the sizes: 331 megabytes for the dev image, about 95 for production.

364
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:28,400
没有 Node，没有 Vite：只有文件和一条代理规则
No Node, no Vite: just files and one proxy rule.

365
00:23:28,650 --> 00:23:32,426
课上的生产环境那页说：只有外面变了
The lecture's production slide: only the outside changes.

366
00:23:32,746 --> 00:23:37,850
在第 20 讲里，NGINX 放在一台云端机器的最前面，用 port 80
In lecture 20, NGINX goes in front on a cloud machine, on port 80;

367
00:23:37,850 --> 00:23:40,789
API 的代码和 port 都不变
the API's code and port stay the same.

368
00:23:41,033 --> 00:23:46,686
额外做一次：停掉它，也停掉 API，再启动生产 container
As an extra, stop it, stop the API too, and start the production container again.

369
00:23:47,006 --> 00:23:48,514
它起不来
It will not start.

370
00:23:48,564 --> 00:23:51,426
那么，快速测一下：一个提供页面的服务器
So, a quick test: why would a page server care

371
00:23:51,426 --> 00:23:53,065
为什么会在乎 API 有没有起来？
whether the API is up?

372
00:23:59,900 --> 00:24:02,993
它马上就退出了：host not found in upstream
It exits at once: host not found in upstream.

373
00:24:03,313 --> 00:24:06,976
原因是 nginx 在启动时就去查代理目标的名字
Nginx looks up the proxy target's name when it starts,

374
00:24:06,976 --> 00:24:08,576
而 API 已经不在了
and the API is gone.

375
00:24:08,796 --> 00:24:10,481
先启动 API
Start the API first.

376
00:24:11,717 --> 00:24:14,106
不用三个终端，一条命令就够
Instead of three terminals, one command.

377
00:24:14,426 --> 00:24:18,778
第 1 步：把你的项目 ID 填进 src 里的 compose 文件
Step 1: put your project ID into the compose file in src.

378
00:24:19,098 --> 00:24:20,534
它出现了两次
It appears twice.

379
00:24:20,584 --> 00:24:23,016
这个文件列的是同样四个服务
The file names the same four services.

380
00:24:23,336 --> 00:24:28,434
加载器会先检查这些书是不是已经在 Chroma 里了，不在才加载
The loader first checks whether the books are already in Chroma, and loads them only if not.

381
00:24:28,684 --> 00:24:31,396
第 2 步：停掉还在跑的一切
Step 2: stop whatever still runs,

382
00:24:31,396 --> 00:24:34,849
然后在 src/vector-db 里 docker compose down
then docker compose down in src/vector-db.

383
00:24:35,169 --> 00:24:37,796
Compose 会警告两个变量没设
Compose warns about two unset variables;

384
00:24:37,796 --> 00:24:40,950
shell 脚本会设它们，所以这没有害处
the shell scripts set them, so this is harmless.

385
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:45,467
第 3 步：进到 src，运行 docker compose up --build
Step 3: change into src, and docker compose up --build.

386
00:24:45,787 --> 00:24:47,387
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

387
00:24:47,534 --> 00:24:52,441
两个警告：网络和 volume 已经存在，是 shell 脚本建的
Two warnings: the network and the volume already exist, made by the shell scripts.

388
00:24:52,761 --> 00:24:54,681
它们是警告，不是错误
They are warnings, not errors.

389
00:24:55,001 --> 00:24:56,963
然后建出四个 container
Then four containers are created.

390
00:24:58,667 --> 00:25:01,326
Chroma、uvicorn 和 Vite 同时启动
Chroma, uvicorn and Vite start together,

391
00:25:01,326 --> 00:25:05,515
加载器以 0 退出：它发现书已经加载过了
and the loader exits with 0: it found the books already loaded.

392
00:25:09,984 --> 00:25:14,485
第 4 步：打开 localhost:3000 和 API 文档
Step 4: open localhost:3000 and the API docs.

393
00:25:14,805 --> 00:25:19,456
有一个小疏漏：README 写的是 port 900；请用 9000
A small slip: the README prints port 900; use 9000.

394
00:25:19,700 --> 00:25:21,153
第 5 步：按 Ctrl-C
Step 5: Ctrl+C,

395
00:25:21,153 --> 00:25:25,140
然后 docker compose down 会删掉全部四个 container
then docker compose down removes all four containers.

396
00:25:26,117 --> 00:25:27,210
Docker Cleanup
Docker cleanup:

397
00:25:27,210 --> 00:25:30,490
在 vector-db 里 compose down，已经什么都不剩了
compose down in vector-db finds nothing left.

398
00:25:30,810 --> 00:25:32,760
命令 docker system prune 会先问你
Docker system prune asks first,

399
00:25:32,760 --> 00:25:37,317
然后删掉网络和大约 4.5 GB 的构建缓存
then deletes the network and about four and a half gigabytes of build cache.

400
00:25:37,567 --> 00:25:39,778
命令 prune 会保留每个打了 tag 的 image
Prune keeps every tagged image,

401
00:25:39,778 --> 00:25:43,026
包括超过 4 GB 的 API image
including the API's image of over 4 gigabytes,

402
00:25:43,026 --> 00:25:45,012
还有 node modules 这个 volume
and the node_modules volume.

403
00:25:45,332 --> 00:25:47,887
按名字把它们删掉，如果你需要这块磁盘空间的话
Remove those by name if you need the disk.

404
00:25:49,083 --> 00:25:52,710
现在是教程 24，课上讲的简单前端
Now Tutorial 24, the lecture's simple frontend.

405
00:25:53,030 --> 00:25:55,927
录制当天 main 分支删掉了它
Main dropped it on the recording day;

406
00:25:55,927 --> 00:26:00,624
2025 分支还留着，连同提供它的去年的 API
branch 2025 keeps it, with last year's API, which serves it.

407
00:26:00,944 --> 00:26:04,141
2025 分支要构建它自己的大 image
Branch 2025 builds its own big images:

408
00:26:04,141 --> 00:26:08,347
如果磁盘紧张，先删掉 main 分支的 image
if your disk is tight, remove main's images first.

409
00:26:08,583 --> 00:26:11,150
命令 git switch 2025 一开始会拒绝
git switch 2025 refuses at first:

410
00:26:11,150 --> 00:26:14,727
你对四个文件的修改会被覆盖
your edits to four files would be overwritten.

411
00:26:15,047 --> 00:26:17,116
额外用 stash 把它们先放到一边
An extra stash puts them aside.

412
00:26:18,333 --> 00:26:22,088
额外看一下 log，是去年的 commit，里面有 frontend-simple
An extra log shows last year's commit, with frontend-simple.

413
00:26:22,408 --> 00:26:25,495
它的 vector-db 脚本要另一个密钥名
Its vector-db script wants a second key name,

414
00:26:25,495 --> 00:26:29,405
所以把你的密钥按这个名字再拷一份，再把项目 ID 设一遍
so copy your key under it, and set your project ID again.

415
00:26:32,583 --> 00:26:34,978
Vector DB 的第 1 到 3 步
Vector DB steps 1 to 3,

416
00:26:34,978 --> 00:26:38,727
从 cheese-app-v2 的上一级目录开始
from the folder above cheese-app-v2,

417
00:26:38,727 --> 00:26:41,955
照 2025 分支 README 的写法
as the 2025 README spells them,

418
00:26:41,955 --> 00:26:45,703
最后是同样的加载：14,356 个 chunk
end in the same load: 14,356 chunks.

419
00:26:46,023 --> 00:26:49,095
它的 Chroma image 的 tag 是 latest，现在还能用
Its Chroma image is tagged latest and still works.

420
00:26:49,415 --> 00:26:51,826
用 exit 退出；Chroma 还在跑
Leave with exit; Chroma keeps running.

421
00:26:52,383 --> 00:26:54,373
Backend 的第 1、2、4 步
Backend steps 1, 2 and 4,

422
00:26:54,373 --> 00:26:58,911
在一个新终端里，从放着两个 clone 的目录开始
in a new terminal from the folder that holds both clones:

423
00:26:58,911 --> 00:27:04,244
进到 API 目录，sh docker-shell.sh，然后 uvicorn server
change into the API folder, sh docker-shell.sh, and uvicorn_server.

424
00:27:04,564 --> 00:27:06,164
暂停一下，把它启动起来
Pause and start it.

425
00:27:06,483 --> 00:27:09,947
和 main 分支有两点不同：重载器是 WatchFiles
Two differences from main: the reloader is WatchFiles,

426
00:27:09,947 --> 00:27:13,538
而且模型在 application startup complete 之前就加载
and the model loads before application startup complete,

427
00:27:13,538 --> 00:27:16,296
所以启动要等，也没有就绪探针
so start-up waits, with no readiness probe.

428
00:27:18,016 --> 00:27:22,837
然后验证 localhost:9000：Welcome to AC215
Then verify localhost:9000: welcome to AC215.

429
00:27:23,157 --> 00:27:29,305
说明一点：2025 分支 README 要你启用的演示路由和 router
A small note: the demo route and the routers the 2025 README asks you to enable

430
00:27:29,305 --> 00:27:32,885
除了 RAG 和 agent，已经都在代码里了
are already in the code, except RAG and agent.

431
00:27:33,205 --> 00:27:36,235
别再贴一遍，否则路由就重复了
Don't paste them again, or the route is duplicated.

432
00:27:36,483 --> 00:27:39,551
还有，去年的 Gemini 模型已经退役了
Also, last year's Gemini model is retired:

433
00:27:39,551 --> 00:27:44,736
就算有密钥，它的聊天也会失败，得先更新模型和区域才行
even with a key, its chat fails until the model and region are updated;

434
00:27:44,736 --> 00:27:46,488
main 分支用的是当前的模型
main uses a current one.

435
00:27:47,450 --> 00:27:51,663
还有接下来要紧的：允许所有 origin 的 CORS 中间件
And what matters next: CORS middleware that allows every origin,

436
00:27:51,663 --> 00:27:54,362
也就是 main 分支已经不再需要的那张许可条
the permission slip main no longer needs.

437
00:27:55,683 --> 00:28:01,891
教程 24，第 1 步：进到 cheese-app-v2/src/frontend-simple
Tutorial 24, step 1: cd cheese-app-v2/src/frontend-simple.

438
00:28:02,211 --> 00:28:05,752
第 2、3 步：sh docker-shell.sh
Steps 2 and 3: sh docker-shell.sh,

439
00:28:05,752 --> 00:28:08,355
然后在 8080 上跑 http-server
then http-server on 8080.

440
00:28:08,675 --> 00:28:10,133
暂停一下，把它启动起来
Pause and start it.

441
00:28:10,183 --> 00:28:13,063
Home page：打开 index.html
Home page: open index.html.

442
00:28:13,383 --> 00:28:17,522
首页链接到另外两个页面：简报和聊天
The landing page links to two more pages: newsletters and chat.

443
00:28:17,766 --> 00:28:21,371
Newsletter feature：打开 newsletters.html
Newsletter feature: open newsletters.html.

444
00:28:21,691 --> 00:28:25,382
它的脚本写明了 API：localhost:9000
Its script names the API: localhost:9000.

445
00:28:25,702 --> 00:28:28,294
这是课上的第二趟
This is the lecture's second trip:

446
00:28:28,294 --> 00:28:33,020
页面来自 8080，而它的 JavaScript 自己去调用 9000
the page came from 8080, and its JavaScript calls 9000 itself.

447
00:28:33,266 --> 00:28:36,402
同一台笔记本，不同的 port，所以是不同的 origin
Same laptop, different port, so a different origin.

448
00:28:36,722 --> 00:28:41,032
现在浏览器会检查每一个回答：服务器允许这个 origin 了吗？
Now the browser checks every answer: did the server allow this origin?

449
00:28:41,266 --> 00:28:44,125
额外用 curl 发送浏览器会发的东西
An extra curl sends what the browser sends.

450
00:28:44,445 --> 00:28:48,393
API 的回答里带着 access-control-allow-origin
The API answers with access-control-allow-origin *,

451
00:28:48,393 --> 00:28:49,993
星号，许可了
permission granted.

452
00:28:52,183 --> 00:28:58,711
先是 307，然后是 200：两个路径差一个斜杠，多跑了一趟
First comes 307, then 200: the paths differ by one slash, an extra round trip.

453
00:28:58,950 --> 00:29:03,835
Chat feature：打开 chat.html，问一下奶酪是怎么做的
Chat feature: open chat.html and ask how cheese is made.

454
00:29:04,155 --> 00:29:09,211
现在浏览器加了一步课上从没画过的：第 0 步，预检
Now the browser adds a step the lecture never draws: step zero, the preflight.

455
00:29:11,433 --> 00:29:15,444
一个带自定义请求头的 JSON POST 请求会让浏览器先问一声
A JSON post with a custom header makes the browser ask first,

456
00:29:15,444 --> 00:29:17,044
用的是一个 OPTIONS 请求
with an OPTIONS request.

457
00:29:17,342 --> 00:29:23,145
回答允许任何 origin、这些方法和这两个请求头，有效 600 秒
The answer allows any origin, these methods and these two headers, for 600 seconds.

458
00:29:23,866 --> 00:29:29,629
日志里：OPTIONS 200，然后 POST 被 307 弹了一下
The log: OPTIONS 200, then the post bounces with 307 and ends

459
00:29:29,629 --> 00:29:32,463
最后是 500，同一个 Gemini 错误
in 500, the same Gemini error.

460
00:29:32,783 --> 00:29:37,797
这个 500 也带着许可头，所以浏览器显示的是真正的错误
That 500 carries the permission header too, so the browser shows the real error.

461
00:29:38,033 --> 00:29:41,834
所以 CORS 是浏览器的规则，管的是服务器给不给许可
So CORS is the browser's rule about the server's permission;

462
00:29:41,834 --> 00:29:44,177
curl 和文档页都碰不到它
curl and the docs page never meet it.

463
00:29:44,416 --> 00:29:46,016
那么，快速测一下
So, a quick test.

464
00:29:46,080 --> 00:29:50,261
去年的页面需要 CORS，今年的 React 应用不需要
Last year's page needed CORS, and this year's React app does not.

465
00:29:50,581 --> 00:29:54,614
变的是什么：API、浏览器，还是它调用的 origin？
What changed: the API, the browser, or the origin it calls?

466
00:30:03,450 --> 00:30:04,723
是 origin
The origin.

467
00:30:04,773 --> 00:30:09,978
React 页面调用自己的 origin，由代理转发：没什么需要许可的
The React page calls its own origin, and a proxy forwards: nothing to permit.

468
00:30:10,298 --> 00:30:14,010
API 于是去掉了这个中间件，因为已经没有谁需要它
The API then dropped the middleware, because nothing needed it.

469
00:30:14,250 --> 00:30:17,493
要停止，在两个终端里都按 Ctrl-C 再 exit
To stop, Ctrl+C and exit in both terminals.

470
00:30:17,813 --> 00:30:20,250
额外地，停掉去年的 Chroma
As extras, stop last year's Chroma,

471
00:30:20,250 --> 00:30:23,452
丢弃这个分支上的修改，切回 main 分支
discard the branch's edits and switch to main;

472
00:30:23,452 --> 00:30:25,471
用 git stash pop 恢复你的修改
git stash pop restores yours.

473
00:30:26,717 --> 00:30:30,344
走之前，一份清理清单，每一项前面都做过一次
Before you go, a cleanup checklist, all done once already.

474
00:30:30,664 --> 00:30:34,163
退出每个 container、compose down、切回 main 分支
Exit every container, compose down, back to main,

475
00:30:34,163 --> 00:30:36,306
先看清单再 prune
prune after checking its list;

476
00:30:36,306 --> 00:30:40,520
然后按名字删掉 node modules 这个 volume 和大 image
then remove the node_modules volume and big images by name.

477
00:30:40,840 --> 00:30:42,589
你的密钥留在 secrets 里
Your key stays in secrets.

478
00:30:42,834 --> 00:30:48,125
这是完整的一趟，开头的问题也有了答案：浏览器只和 3000 说话
Here is the whole trip, with the hook answered: the browser talks only to 3000.

479
00:30:48,445 --> 00:30:52,546
在里面，开发环境的 Vite 或生产环境的 nginx
Inside, Vite in development or nginx in production

480
00:30:52,546 --> 00:30:55,828
按名字把 /api 送到 9000 上的 uvicorn
carries /api by name to uvicorn on 9000,

481
00:30:55,828 --> 00:30:58,535
由一个 router 运行函数
where a router runs the function.

482
00:30:58,855 --> 00:31:03,570
JSON 原路返回：同一个 origin，不需要许可
The JSON comes back the same way: one origin, no permission needed.

483
00:31:04,234 --> 00:31:05,983
回到课上的蓝图
Back to the lecture's blueprint.

484
00:31:06,303 --> 00:31:08,885
你的四个方框升进了集群里
Your four boxes rise into the cluster.

485
00:31:09,205 --> 00:31:13,760
最前面的 NGINX、registry 和持久化磁盘还是虚线
NGINX in front, the registry and the persistent disk are still dashed:

486
00:31:13,760 --> 00:31:15,647
接下来的几讲会把它们建出来
the next lectures build them.

487
00:31:15,884 --> 00:31:21,502
在你的课程项目里，课上要你画出自己的解决方案架构和技术架构
For your project, the lecture asks you to draw your solution and technical architecture,

488
00:31:21,502 --> 00:31:25,014
还给了一门速成课和一个模板 repo
and points to a crash course and a template repository.

489
00:31:25,250 --> 00:31:27,191
自测一下，每道题都暂停想一想
Test yourself, pausing on each.

490
00:31:27,511 --> 00:31:30,157
第一题：在 main 分支上追踪一次简报请求
One: trace a newsletters request on main.

491
00:31:30,477 --> 00:31:33,101
浏览器和哪个 container 说话
Which container does the browser talk to,

492
00:31:33,101 --> 00:31:35,868
port 9000 又是在哪一步出现的？第二题
and where does port 9000 come in? Two:

493
00:31:35,868 --> 00:31:42,241
api.service:app、--host 0.0.0.0 和 --reload 各起什么作用
what do api.service:app, --host 0.0.0.0 and --reload each do,

494
00:31:42,241 --> 00:31:47,674
不带斜杠的 square root 为什么返回 307？
and why does square_root without a slash answer 307?

495
00:31:47,917 --> 00:31:49,880
第三题：/healthz 和 /readyz
Three: /healthz and /readyz.

496
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:52,269
在这个 API 里，它们各检查什么？
What does each one check in this API?

497
00:31:52,517 --> 00:31:55,751
第四题：两条消息之间，聊天存在哪里
Four: where does a chat stay between two messages,

498
00:31:55,751 --> 00:31:58,469
为什么 API 的任何一个副本都能回答它？
and why can any copy of the API answer it?

499
00:31:58,717 --> 00:32:02,959
第五题：开发环境里由哪个文件决定 /api 送到哪里
Five: which file decides where /api goes in development,

500
00:32:02,959 --> 00:32:04,475
生产环境里又是哪个
which in production,

501
00:32:04,475 --> 00:32:09,021
为什么去年的 API 需要 CORS，而 main 分支的不需要？
and why did last year's API need CORS while main's does not?
